    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f71b892539986391",
      "translationZh": "⚡ H Models API: 快速入门",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6febc2f25562164b",
      "translationZh": "📝 完整博客文章: hcompany.ai/newsroom/holo4",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b4d3a67c14804cc3",
      "translationZh": "适用于所有接口的模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b14c81791761607d",
      "translationZh": "Holo4 会在屏幕上点击和输入，编写并运行自己的代码，并调用 MCP 或 API 工具。它会根据任务选择合适的方式。大多数代理模型只针对一种界面进行训练：以 GUI 为中心的模型在没有屏幕时会失明，而偏好工具调用的模型则会被困在没有 API 的应用程序前。实际工作并不是这样孤立的，单个业务任务可能需要结合这些不同的方法。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6aa0984e024b0caf",
      "translationZh": "Holo4 可以在桌面端、网页端、Android、代码沙箱以及业务 API 上运行。在每种情况下它都是同一个模型，并且调用方式完全相同。你不需要为每个平台选择不同的模型。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80586acec24f0e17",
      "translationZh": "Holo4 模型在其 Qwen 基础上有显著提升。Holo4 在长工作流上仅次于最强的封闭模型：在 OSWorld 2.0 上，Holo4 27B 得分 61.7%，而 Opus 5.5 得分 81.8%，且 Holo4 35B-A3B 达到 30.9%。然而，它仅用了数量级更少的参数，并且成本低得多。我们在公开基准上开源了每条得分背后的轨迹：可在 trajectories.hcompany.ai 重放每一步，或从 Hugging Face 下载。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0281b48889a0fecf",
      "translationZh": "具有竞争力的前沿技术，成本仅为其一小部分",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76ff6c40de5d4ac5",
      "translationZh": "在桌面控制（OSWorld 2.0）和 API 使用（AutomationBench）这几个难度最高的学术基准测试中，Holo4 以低得多的单任务成本与前沿模型展开竞争。",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3da8303f9cae1dd",
      "translationZh": "关于成本-性能图表的说明",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1dcd35ac235d4f30",
      "translationZh": "OSWorld 2.0. 成本根据每次 agentic 运行的输入和输出 token 估算。Holo4 按 H Models API 价格（单次运行）定价。Qwen3.8 27B：模型卡得分，成本来自我们在阿里云列表价格下运行的 token。Qwen3.6 35B-A3B：在我们的 harness 中单次运行，按阿里云列表价格计算，且缓存命中使输入价格降至 20%。OpenAI 发布数据提供了 GPT 和 Opus 的努力 sweep；其他封闭和开放权重点使用官方 OSWorld 2.0 排行榜。发布、harness 和任务子集有所不同。该线连接封闭模型中非支配的得分和成本对；Holo4 被排除。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "694bbb8bf4b7b07a",
      "translationZh": "AutomationBench. Holo4、Qwen3.8 27B 和 Qwen3.6 35B-A3B：使用 AutomationBench v1.0.6，在我们的内部 harness 中测量得分和成本。其他模型：公开集得分来自 AutomationBench README ，每任务成本来自官方排行榜 ，该排行榜在私有集上运行。我们将在 Holo4 在私有集上评估完成后报告其结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "84a45176dc93f950",
      "translationZh": "能做工作的 AI",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6173db9c2a9e3f0",
      "translationZh": "在我们的 Agentic Task Factory 提供的环境和任务上训练，Holo4 模型在专业软件上表现出色。下面的例子展示了 Holo4 27B 与其基础模型 Qwen3.8 27B 并排的情况。两个模型使用相同的提示和 harness。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2faf4ffc14336180",
      "translationZh": "3D 建模 · 埃菲尔铁塔",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f17c747f3a9f9538",
      "translationZh": "在 FreeCAD 中构建埃菲尔铁塔的 3D 模型，比例为 1 mm 对应 1 米，以原点为中心并沿 X 和 Y 轴对齐。按照此设计进行操作。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8350c005da2bff5d",
      "translationZh": "塔在每个高度的平面图都是方形的，从不圆形。其中心轴到角落的半宽在ground level（地面）为 62.5 mm，在高度 57 处为 32.5 mm，在高度 115 处为 17.5 mm，在高度 276 处为 9.35 mm。在这些高度之间，半宽沿着一条平滑曲线变化——靠近地面时下降较陡，越往上则变得较缓，永不会是直线。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "beb8d6e9a23680b9",
      "translationZh": "四条相同的腿，每个象限一条，每条腿为方形柱体，其外角遵循该轮廓。每条腿在地面处宽 14 mm，在高度 276 处逐渐变细至 4 mm。腿从地面一直延伸到第一个平台之间是分离的，随着升高而逐渐收敛。它们之间没有填充物：塔是开放的，你可以从每个方向直视通过。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95cf7654dca80390",
      "translationZh": "三个平台，每个都是以轴为中心的实心方形板：在高度57处宽72毫米、厚4毫米；在高度115处宽40毫米、厚3毫米；在高度276处宽22毫米、厚3毫米。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7e11def34659cf1",
      "translationZh": "从高度276到324的桅杆，为方形，底部宽8毫米，逐渐变细至顶部宽2毫米。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f73d0ec9691d3601",
      "translationZh": "每个部件必须是具有非零体积的封闭实体，且任何部件不得填充腿之间的空间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52e8808e7c4aec74",
      "translationZh": "Holo4 27B（84 次调用，1.3M 令牌）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b6e398330833edf",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 27B（60 次调用，1.0M 令牌）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9e215c2822a0f0ed",
      "translationZh": "3D 建模 · H 标志",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c299054c6a285f0",
      "translationZh": "在 FreeCAD 中构建 H 公司标志的 3D 模型：一个实心填充的圆盘与一个块状无衬线大写字母 H 并排放置，两者挤出至相同厚度，两个形状高度相近并相互分离以避免重叠，圆盘的中心与 H 的中线对齐。将两个形状均着色为黑色。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfcd3d77a7c98b0c",
      "translationZh": "Holo4 27B（94 次调用，1.5M 令牌）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "018fdb8ed0611db2",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 27B (118 次调用, 1.9M tokens)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e77ae8fd1f7ca793",
      "translationZh": "游戏设计 · 吃豆人",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ddde227a1933019",
      "translationZh": "在 Godot 中构建一个类似吃豆人的游戏并让它一直运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd6cc64e75bc1078",
      "translationZh": "一个由网格布置的矩形墙壁迷宫，开放通道中填满了小点。玩家标记沿着通道持续移动，吃掉它经过的每个小点并为此得分。三个幽灵在同一通道中移动并追逐玩家。如果幽灵抓住玩家，玩家失去一条生命，一切重置到起始位置。得分和生命值在屏幕上绘制。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83ddd76f643481af",
      "translationZh": "没有人会去玩这个。玩家使用一个简单的启发式方法自行驱动：在每个交叉口，它会朝最近的小点移动，除非幽灵很近，在这种情况下它会远离幽灵。游戏必须无人看管地无限运行，完全不需要键盘输入。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78f038b440576df7",
      "translationZh": "当它正常工作时，启动游戏并让它继续运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6ff74b53dbb2c64",
      "translationZh": "Holo4 27B (68 次调用, 2.4M tokens, 268 行)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5cacd5e0cb336f5",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 27B (197 次调用, 11.4M tokens, 327 行)",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "182c6e3a81cf9c3f",
      "translationZh": "我们是如何构建 Holo4 的",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a93b531c7d705e6b",
      "translationZh": "智能体任务工厂",
      "provider": "gemini",
      "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45dc303458b87dd2",
      "translationZh": "我们内部的智能体管道集合仅从文档出发，构建交互式环境和可验证的任务，例如真实网站的截图或开源软件。迄今为止，它已生成约 10,000 个任务，涵盖 Web 应用、MCP 服务器和桌面环境，包括通过 GUI 和 MCP 暴露相同状态的混合环境。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36a798e3f39239cc",
      "translationZh": "训练",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e3b5b45953d79a15",
      "translationZh": "利用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2020dc8c01eed3f",
      "translationZh": "在训练的同时，我们重建了控制框架，这是一个执行模型动作并管理其上下文数百步的循环，利用了来自 OSWorld 2.0 上代理表现的反馈。代理标记了每个任务失败的原因，工程师审查了他们的修复方案。最大的变化是给代理提供了一个可靠的记忆，可以跟踪数百步，以及桌面机器本身的 Shell。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "023a49da91844c46",
      "translationZh": "Opus 5 (70.2%) 和 GPT-5.6 Sol (66.2%) 在来自 OpenAI 发布图表的 v2026.08.08 离线数据集上使用最大努力部分奖励，如成本性能图中所示。其他参考分数来自模型卡片和官方排行榜。任务发布、子集和测试 harness 各不相同。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8caaeaec5092738",
      "translationZh": "我们的后训练栈旨在适应新的基础模型，并生成能够在不同界面和环境间泛化的智能体。作为 NVIDIA Nemotron Coalition 的成员，我们将最新的栈应用于 Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 模型，作为 Holotron 3 的后续版本。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c11f827a77053dc",
      "translationZh": "同样的配方将 Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 变成了 Holotron4 Nano，这是一个通用型智能体模型，它在 GUI 工作流方面显著优于基础模型，并在暴露了 MCP、API 或编程沙箱的环境中表现优异。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e465cd4e7e01b6d",
      "translationZh": "增益是相对于 Nemotron 3 Nano Omni 的绝对百分点提升。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
